   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "\u2022 project and APIs\n\u2022 Artifact Registry (the image)\n\u2022 Secret Manager (one JSON)\n\u2022 Cloud Run (0 to 1 instance)\n\u2022 API Gateway and API key\n\u2022 budget alert (1 cent, 50%, 100% of $1)\n\u2022 7-day log retention",
   "originalText": "\u2022 project and APIs\n\u2022 Artifact Registry (the image)\n\u2022 Secret Manager (one JSON)\n\u2022 Cloud Run (0 to 1 instance)\n\u2022 API Gateway and API key\n\u2022 budget alert (1 cent, 50%, 100% of $1)\n\u2022 7-day log retention",
   "fontSize": 14,
